*** The FIDE World Championship ***

A legendary cycle unbroken for 135 years


Magnus Carlsen, the highest-rated chess player of all time, and the FIDE Wo=
rld Champion since 2013 takes on Ian Nepomniachtchi, Carlsen's former secon=
d, and one of the only grandmasters with a winning record against Carlsen.

This November, be a part of chess history.



THE CHAMPIONSHIP MATCHUP

The Champion

** Magnus Carlsen
---------------------------------------------------------------------------=
----------
- FIDE World Champion since 2013
- Highest rating of all time
- World #1 for over 10 years
- Undefeated for a record 125 consecutive games (Between 2018-2020)

Peak Rating - 2882
Country - Norway
Age - 30


The Challenger

** Ian Nepomniachtchi
---------------------------------------------------------------------------=
----------
- Won the 2010 and 2020 Russian Superfinal
- Has plus score against Carlsen
- Russia=E2=80=99s #1 chess player

Peak Rating - 2792
Country - Russia
Age - '31'


